OL,4,CTELETEXT                               
OL,6,CG1989FCeefax implements a major       
OL,7,Frelaunch. The majority of the          
OL,8,Ffeatures/fun pages are discontinued.   
OL,9,FThe service now focuses on "hard news".
OL,11,FThe new editorial structure:           
OL,13,F100s - News;                           
OL,14,F200s - Business (BBC Two only);        
OL,15,F300s - Sport;                          
OL,16,F400s - Breakfast (weekdays)/Features   
OL,17,F(weekends);                            
OL,18,F500s - Weather and Travel (BBC One     
OL,19,Fonly);                                 
OL,20,F600s - TV and Radio listings/support   
